        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "It is next submitted that the offence under Sections 466,\n467, 468 and 471 of IPC is not made out nor the offence punishable under Section 7 of the Essential Commodities Act is made out in the absence of any violation of any control order a"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "f745de6a5b0549a0b4500dfc674ef77c_23",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\n6. Having heard the submissions made at the Bar and after going through the materials available in the record, so far as the offence punishable under Section 460 of the IPC is concerned, the same provides that when a person voluntarily cau"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "9317a0285d594ef5a2decc1e22079791_24",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Now coming to the facts of the case, there is absolutely no allegation against the petitioner of committing lurking house trespass by night, or house breaking by night nor there is any allegation against the petitioner of voluntarily causin"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "f5b6a8576c704c39b1a3dbb990c4c0dd_25",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "So in the considered opinion of this court, the offence punishable under Section 460 of IPC is not made out."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "1944662e3b71490a8884d13eca1467d3_26",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "7. So far as the offence punishable under Section 467 of IPC is concerned, the same provides punishment for forgery of any valuable security or WILL or an authority to adopt a son etc. but there is no allegation, even remotely, of the same "
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "9ee0fef808764bc89c18524c4ec14680_27",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Hence, in the considered opinion of this Court, the offence punishable under Section 467 of IPC is not made out even if the entire allegations made against the petitioner are considered to be true in their entirety."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "9d0c2883c5104f55a602466629b481c6_28",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "8. So far as the offence punishable under Section 468 of IPC is concerned, the same relates to committing forgery intending that the document or electronic record, shall be used for the purpose of cheating."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "dee008336d1e4d98bc41365f3999a0a7_29",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Now coming to the facts of the case, there is no allegation against the petitioner of committing any forgery of any document or electronic record, hence in the considered opinion of this Court, the offence punishable under Section 468 of IP"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "d41442b23784498a9577ce6582d0b9d3_30",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "9. So far as the offence punishable under Section and Section 16 of the Prevention of Food Adulteration Act 1954 is concerned, since Section 97 of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 has repealed inter alia the Prevention of Food Adulte"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "277c322aa74b47b2b0c3e9b7f0013dfb_31",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": ", so certainly, learned SDJM, has committed grave illegality by taking cognizance of statue which has already been repealed."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "7048a05ba14e40d1a2e0b0cc036123e5_32",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "10. So far as the offence punishable under Section 272 and 273 of IPC is concerned, certainly, the allegations made against the petitioner prima facie, is sufficient to constitute the offence punishable under Section 272 and 273 of IPC."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "38a003a733b74787bccff71d8213321b_33",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
