        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "11. So far as the judgment of the Hon'ble Supreme Court of India, in the case of Ram Nath vs. State of Uttar Pradesh & Ors. (supra) is concerned, the same prohibits simultaneous prosecution for the provisions under section 272 and 273 of th"
      },
